      "text": "So maybe we can just close out with your thoughts about the mainstream media and their role in all of this."
    },
    {
      "end": 23440.16,
      "start": 23431.78,
      "text": "Yeah, sure. So I think the mainstream media and the big tech at large, they're definitely culpable for what's going on in the world."
    },
    {
      "end": 23443.06,
